{"use":"content/section","key":"story","data":{"title":"Our story"},"slots":{"body":[{"use":"content/prose","key":"text","data":{"html":"<p>Twelve paddlers and climbers founded the co-op in 1987 in a rented garage. Today 9,400 members own it, and every member gets one vote at the annual meeting.</p>"}}]}},
{"use":"content/section","key":"beliefs","data":{"title":"What we believe"},"slots":{"body":[{"use":"content/prose","key":"list","data":{"html":"<ol><li>Repair before replace. Our workshop fixed 3,100 items last year.</li><li>Pay people fairly. Every employee earns at least the regional living wage.</li><li>Leave places better. We give 2% of sales to trail and shoreline groups.</li></ol>"}}]}},
{"use":"content/section","key":"milestones","data":{"title":"Milestones"},"slots":{"body":[{"use":"data/description-list","key":"list","data":{"items":[{"term":"1987","description":"Founded in a garage on Pier Road."},{"term":"1999","description":"Opened the Alder Street store."},{"term":"2014","description":"Started the rental program."},{"term":"2023","description":"Opened the repair workshop."}]}}]}},
{"use":"content/quote","key":"chair","data":{"quote":"We are not here to sell more gear. We are here to help people get outside with the gear they already have.","author":"Ines Okafor","source":"Board chair"}},
